{"id":"megapunk","lines":[{"t":1.177,"end":2.377,"chars":[0],"who":"Roxanne","text":"No.","de":"Nein.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":5.637,"end":7.27,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"Well that was easy.","de":"Na, das war ja einfach.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":7.361,"end":9.694,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"Looks like there's only one loose end now.","de":"Sieht aus, als gäb's nur noch ein loses Ende.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":9.673,"end":10.873,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"(GRUNT)","de":"*Grunz*","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":20.434,"end":24.017,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"Please, let's have a little respect for public transportation.","de":"Bitte, ein bisschen Respekt vor dem öffentlichen Nahverkehr.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":24.839,"end":26.272,"chars":[0],"who":"Roxanne","text":"You came back!","de":"Du bist zurückgekommen!","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":26.326,"end":27.959,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"You were right, Roxanne","de":"Du hattest recht, Roxanne","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":28.202,"end":29.669,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"I never should have left.","de":"Ich hätte nie gehen sollen.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":29.614,"end":32.164,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"Woah! I—I thought you were dead!","de":"Wow! I-Ich dachte, du wärst tot!","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":32.145,"end":35.445,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"My death was... greatly exaggerated.","de":"Mein Tod war... stark übertrieben.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":35.544,"end":39.027,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"So, you're the punk I've heard about.","de":"Also bist du der Punk, von dem ich gehört hab.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":40.149,"end":41.449,"chars":[0],"who":"Roxanne","text":"(THIS GUY SHIT HIMSELF)","de":"(DER HAT SICH EINGESCHISSEN)","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":50.328,"end":51.528,"chars":[3],"who":"Megamind","text":"(MOAN)","de":"*Stöhnen*","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":51.811,"end":55.194,"chars":[3],"who":"Megamind","text":"I'm sorry. I did the best I could.","de":"Tut mir leid. Ich hab mein Bestes gegeben.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":55.697,"end":59.197,"chars":[0],"who":"Roxanne","text":"(sniffles) I'm so proud of you.","de":"*schnieft* Ich bin so stolz auf dich.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":62.761,"end":63.961,"chars":[0],"who":"Roxanne","text":"Minion?","de":"Minion?","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":64.584,"end":67.851,"chars":[4],"who":"Minion","text":"Surprise. Heh heh heh..","de":"Überraschung. Heh heh heh..","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":67.714,"end":70.314,"chars":[4],"who":"Minion","text":"He's the real hero.","de":"Er ist der echte Held.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":72.328,"end":73.445,"chars":[0],"who":"Roxanne","text":"(GASP)","de":"*Keuchen*","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":76.964,"end":78.164,"chars":[0],"who":"Roxanne","text":"Megamind!","de":"Megamind!","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":79.792,"end":80.875,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"Going somewhere?","de":"Irgendwohin unterwegs?","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":81.295,"end":82.078,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"AH!","de":"AH!","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":82.061,"end":83.494,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"Besides jail?","de":"Außer ins Gefängnis?","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":83.478,"end":85.345,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"(SCREAM)","de":"*Schrei*","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":87.784,"end":88.467,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"AH!","de":"AH!","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":90.24,"end":90.99,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"a","de":"a","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":90.969,"end":92.736,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"No, not in the face man, please!","de":"Nein, nicht ins Gesicht, Mann, bitte!","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":92.528,"end":96.128,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"If you know what's good for you, Tighten, you'll stay out of Metrocity.","de":"Wenn du weißt, was gut für dich ist, Tighten, bleibst du aus Metrocity raus.","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":96.13,"end":96.613,"chars":[1],"who":"Tighten","text":"You got it!","de":"Verstanden!","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":96.602,"end":97.802,"chars":[2],"who":"Metroman","text":"For good!","de":"Für immer!","orig":"scenes/megapunk/lines/30.mp3"}]}